sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Seller
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API route
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant TG as Telegram bot
  participant H as OTP hook route

  S->>W: Enters phone number
  W->>A: POST /api/auth/otp/send
  A->>DB: Is this phone linked? (telegram_chat_for)
  alt Linked
    A->>H: Supabase Auth calls the Send SMS hook
    H->>TG: sendMessage with the 6-digit code
    TG-->>S: Message in Telegram
    A-->>W: 200 sent
  else Not linked
    A->>DB: telegram_request_link (one-time code, 15 min)
    A-->>W: 200 needs_telegram_link and Start link
    W-->>S: Open Telegram
    S->>TG: Presses Start
    TG->>A: Webhook /start one-time code
    A->>DB: telegram_attach_start
    TG-->>S: Share my number button
    S->>TG: Shares own contact
    TG->>A: Webhook with contact
    A->>A: contact.user_id equals sender?
    A->>DB: telegram_complete_link (number equals typed number?)
    DB-->>A: linked
    TG-->>S: Linked message
    W->>A: Polls /api/auth/telegram/status
    A-->>W: linked true
    W->>A: POST /api/auth/otp/send again, code is sent
  end
